      en: ["The power plant was commissioned during the mid-1980s.", "It has a total installed capacity of around 18 megawatts.", "The Rwegura reservoir serves as the primary water source.", "The facility is situated at an elevation of over 2,000 meters.", "The World Bank provided funding for the plant's development.", "It is the largest hydroelectric facility in northern Burundi."],
